{% doc %}
  @prompt
    **"Create a distinctive, perfectly centered product card layout on a clean light grey background, inspired by image_12.png. This section should feature a single, large, rounded white container that 'floats' in the screen's center with substantial margins all around.
    Layout:
    • Right-Side Image: In the LEFT half of this container, add a high-quality product image of a supplement bottle.
    • Left-Side Text (Structured Content): The
    RIGHT half contains all text, matching the content and style from image_12.png. All text elements are perfectly vertically aligned.
    Content Elements:
    1. Header Line (centered, bold, blue/black
    text）：*
    ★ ★ ★ ★ ★
    4.8/5.0 (1,200+ Reviews) •
    50,000+ Men
    
    2. Main Title (centered, bold, blue/black text):
    Ascendant™ Hemo Flow
    3. Description Paragraph (centered, black text): Thicker blood steals your energy, kills your pump, raises your pressure, and fogs your brain. Hemo Flow addresses all three layers behind it.
    4. Bullet List (centered, using custom checkmarks): Group the list items tightly.
    5. Main Button: A centered, large button with a striking, bold green background and blue text:
    '[Add to Protocol »]'. Add the green border/ shadow effect seen in image_12.png.
    6. Footer text (centered, small grey text): 30-
    Day Money-Back Guarantee . Free Shipping
    Over $75
    
    Mobile Responsive & Aesthetic:
    On mobile devices, automatically stack the columns: the Image moves to the TOP and all Text elements move BELOW it. Significantly reduce the vertical spacing (margins and padding) between all text elements (headings, list items, paragraphs) to create a tight, compact, and vertically short layout on smaller screens. Shrink the heading font size slightly for mobile. Ensure the entire white container has generous rounded corners."**, **"Eliminate all white space surrounding the product image on Desktop and Mobile.
    1. Zero Margin Image: Set all margins and padding for the image element to Opx. The image must perfectly touch the top, bottom, and left edges of its container box.
    2. Object Fit: Set the image 'object-fit' to 'cover' or 'fill' so that it expands to occupy the entire height and width of the left column without leaving any white gaps.
    3. Remove Column Gap: Ensure there is no
    'gutter' or empty space between the right edge of the image and the start of the text column.
    4. Container Flush: The image should look like it is 'bleeding' into the edges of the white card container on the top, bottom, and left sides, exactly like a professional split-screen layout."**, **'Adjust the column proportions and image scaling to eliminate the internal white borders.
    1. Column Ratio: Change the split of the container so the Image Column (Left) is wider than the Text Column (Right). Set the ratio to approximately 55% for the image and 45% for the text.
    2. Full Bleed Image: Ensure the image has zero padding on the top, bottom, and left sides. It must touch the outer edges of the white card perfectly.
    3. Image Fit: Set the 'Image Object Fit' to 'Cover' so that the man's photo fills the entire heightened column without leaving any white gaps at the corners.
    4. Text Padding: Add a small amount of internal padding to the right-side text column so the content doesn't feel cramped against the newly enlarged image."**, **'Adjust the column proportions and image scaling to eliminate the internal white borders.
    1. Column Ratio: Change the split of the container so the Image Column (Left) is wider than the Text Column (Right). Set the ratio to approximately 50% for the image and 50% for the text.
    2. Full Bleed Image: Ensure the image has zero padding on the top, bottom, and left sides. It must touch the outer edges of the white card perfectly.
    3. Image Fit: Set the 'Image Object Fit' to 'Cover' so that the man's photo fills the entire heightened column without leaving any white gaps at the corners.
    4. Text Padding: Add a small amount of internal padding to the right-side text column so the content doesn't feel cramped against the newly enlarged image."**, **"Apply a strict LEFT-ALIGNMENT to the stars, the main heading, the description paragraph, and the bullet points ONLY.
    1. Vertical Alignment: Every single text element located ABOVE the button must start from the exact same vertical line on the left.
    2. Remove Centering: Specifically, remove the center-alignment from the 'Ascendant™ Hemo Flow' heading and the 'Thicker blood...' description paragraph. They are currently centered; move them to be flush-left with the stars and checkmarks.
    3. Button Isolation: Do NOT change the alignment of the 'Add to Protocol' button. Let it stay exactly where it is (centered or current position).
    4. No Indentation: Ensure there is zero staggered spacing. All four top elements should form a perfectly straight edge on the left side of the text column."**, remove list icon , make star size a little bit big and color yellow just stars not full rating line, decrease this section length on mobile, **"Apply these adjustments ONLY to the mobile view to ensure all text fits on single lines.
    1. Rating Line: Reduce the font size and letter-spacing of the review line ('4.8/5.0... 50,000+
    Men') specifically on mobile so that the entire phrase fits on one single line without wrapping to a second line.
    2. List Items: For the bulleted list, slightly decrease the font size and ensure each benefit (e.g., 'Nattokinase 2,000 FU...') stays on one line. No text in the list should break into a second line.
    3. Padding: If needed, slightly reduce the left and right padding of the text container on mobile to give the words more horizontal room.
    4. Aesthetic Check: Ensure the text remains clearly readable while being compact and perfectly aligned."**
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-product-card-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.outer_background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.outer_padding_desktop }}px;
  }

  .ai-product-card-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
    box-shadow: 0 {{ block.settings.shadow_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_blur }}px rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.shadow_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }});
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .ai-product-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 0 0 {{ block.settings.image_column_width }}%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    justify-content: stretch;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-product-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-product-card-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    text-align: left;
    gap: {{ block.settings.content_spacing }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.inner_padding }}px;
  }

  .ai-product-card-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.header_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.header_text_color }};
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0;
    text-align: left;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-product-card-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.star_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.star_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .ai-product-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_text_color }};
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0;
    text-align: left;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-product-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    text-align: left;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-product-card-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: {{ block.settings.list_item_spacing }}px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-product-card-list-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.list_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.list_text_color }};
    text-align: left;
    white-space: normal;
  }

  .ai-product-card-button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-product-card-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_background_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    border: {{ block.settings.button_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.button_border_color }};
    box-shadow: 0 {{ block.settings.button_shadow_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_shadow_blur }}px {{ block.settings.button_shadow_color }};
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .ai-product-card-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_background_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_text_color }};
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 {{ block.settings.button_shadow_vertical | plus: 2 }}px {{ block.settings.button_shadow_blur | plus: 4 }}px {{ block.settings.button_shadow_color }};
  }

  .ai-product-card-footer-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-product-card-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.footer_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.footer_text_color }};
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-product-card-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.outer_padding_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-product-card-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0;
    }

    .ai-product-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      min-height: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_height }}px;
    }

    .ai-product-card-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: {{ block.settings.content_spacing_mobile }}px;
      padding: {{ block.settings.inner_padding_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-product-card-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.header_font_size_mobile }}px;
      letter-spacing: -0.2px;
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }

    .ai-product-card-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.star_size_mobile }}px;
      letter-spacing: 0px;
    }

    .ai-product-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-product-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size_mobile }}px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .ai-product-card-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: {{ block.settings.list_item_spacing_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-product-card-list-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.list_font_size_mobile }}px;
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }

    .ai-product-card-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size_mobile }}px;
      padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical_mobile }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-product-card-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.footer_font_size_mobile }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}
{% if request.page_type == 'page' and handle == 'listicle-3' %}
<product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-product-card-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-product-card-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-product-card-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.product_image %}
        <img
          src="{{ block.settings.product_image | image_url: width: 1000 }}"
          alt="{{ block.settings.product_image.alt | escape }}"
          loading="lazy"
          width="{{ block.settings.product_image.width }}"
          height="{{ block.settings.product_image.height }}"
        >
      {% else %}
        <div style="width: 100%; height: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background-color: #f4f4f4;">
          {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-product-card-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.header_text != blank %}
        <div class="ai-product-card-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <span class="ai-stars-{{ ai_gen_id }}">★ ★ ★ ★ ★</span> {{ block.settings.header_text }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.product_title != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-product-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.product_title }}
        </h2>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.description_text != blank %}
        <p class="ai-product-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.description_text }}
        </p>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.show_list %}
        <ul class="ai-product-card-list-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.list_item_1 != blank %}
            <li class="ai-product-card-list-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.list_item_1 }}
            </li>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.list_item_2 != blank %}
            <li class="ai-product-card-list-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.list_item_2 }}
            </li>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.list_item_3 != blank %}
            <li class="ai-product-card-list-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.list_item_3 }}
            </li>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.list_item_4 != blank %}
            <li class="ai-product-card-list-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.list_item_4 }}
            </li>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.list_item_5 != blank %}
            <li class="ai-product-card-list-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.list_item_5 }}
            </li>
          {% endif %}
        </ul>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.button_text != blank %}
        <div class="ai-product-card-button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <a href="{{ block.settings.button_link }}" class="ai-product-card-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.button_text }}
          </a>
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.footer_text != blank %}
        <div class="ai-product-card-footer-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <p class="ai-product-card-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.footer_text }}
          </p>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class ProductCard{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }
    }
    customElements.define('product-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}', ProductCard{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>
{% endif %}
